# WiFi credentials — loaded by libionity/CMakeLists.txt
# Copy this file to wifi_config.cmake and fill in your values.
# wifi_config.cmake is gitignored and will NOT be pushed to GitHub.

# Option A: Set credentials here
# set(WIFI_SSID "YourWiFiSSID")
# set(WIFI_PASS "YourWiFiPassword")

# Option B: Set environment variables before building
#   Windows: set IONITY_WIFI_SSID=YourSSID && set IONITY_WIFI_PASS=YourPass
#   Linux:   export IONITY_WIFI_SSID="YourSSID" && export IONITY_WIFI_PASS="YourPass"

# Option C: Pass via cmake -D flags
#   cmake -DWIFI_SSID="YourSSID" -DWIFI_PASS="YourPass" ..